sequenceDiagram
  participant App as App (spoke VPC, no NAT)
  participant R as Route 53 Resolver (spoke VPC)
  participant PHZ as PHZ sqs.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com (associated)
  participant TGW as Transit Gateway
  participant EP as SQS interface endpoint (hub VPC, Private DNS OFF)
  participant SQS as Amazon SQS
  App->>R: resolve sqs.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com
  R->>PHZ: private hosted zone match
  PHZ-->>R: Alias → endpoint ENI private IP (10.0.x.x)
  R-->>App: 10.0.x.x
  App->>TGW: HTTPS 443 to 10.0.x.x
  TGW->>EP: route to hub VPC
  EP->>SQS: PrivateLink
  SQS-->>App: response (never touches internet)
